  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agreement on representation by SE, IVI board - Agreement for BoT representation for IVI 2014</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tj&#xe4;nstek&#xf6;ps&#xf6;verenskommelse f&#xf6;r styrelseuppdrag IVI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FR&#xc5;GAN HAR &#xc4;NDRATS &#x2013; SE &#xd6;VER DITT SVAR

Sverige har haft en plats i IVIs styrelse sedan 2006 och sedan 2012 sitter Viveka Persson som representant f&#xf6;r Sverige. Under perioden 2006-2012 var det dessutom en svensk professor som var styrelseordf&#xf6;rande p&#xe5; IVI.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Vaccine Institute is an NGO aiming at making vaccines   available in LICs in order to reduce the burden of childhood diseases and thus &lt;5 mortality. Sweden has since 2006 a representative in      IVI&apos;s Board of Trustees and the Swedish Ministry of Foreign Affairs   has given Sida the administrative responsibility to handle this.</narrative>
  </description>
